<section class="maker-section shell" aria-labelledby="maker-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / The person behind the pixels</p><div class="maker-grid"><h2 id="maker-title">Built by me.<br>Shaped by use.</h2><div><p>I’m Kyle Reddoch, an independent developer in Texas. RelayByte is the home for the apps I build: useful ideas, carefully worked through.</p><p>My background in cybersecurity shapes how I think about software. Clear controls, sensible defaults, and an honest explanation of what an app does with your data all matter to me.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">A little more about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
